   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Capacity and Effectiveness of Provincial, Municipal and County Auditors in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop the capacity and effectivenss of China National Audit Office in supporting preparation of audit manuals and audit trainers. 1.  Devloping audit manuals including the Foreign Debts Audit Manual, the Environmental Audit Manual and the Audit Manual for Execution of Central Government Budgets. 2.  Implement a training program for trainers including the development of a traiining curriculum, preparation of training materials based on audit manuals, carrying out of workships and establishment of a database on trainers in the provincial audit offices.</narrative>
  </description>
